    "chunk_text": "\u00f0am \u00f0e ge sylfe w\u00e6ron fordrifene & utancymene of Egypta lande. Hundseofontigra sum eowre f\u00e6deras w\u00e6ron on Egypta lande, & Drihten, eower God, eow LUFIA\u00d0 Drihten eowerne God, & wyrcea\u00f0 his bebodu & his \u00e6 & his domas on \u00e6lcne timan. Oncnawa\u00f0 to d\u00e6g \u00f0a \u00feingc \u00f0e eowre bearn nyton, \u00f0a \u00f0e ne gehyrdon Drihtnes lare, eowres Godes, & & gemuna\u00f0 hw\u00e6t he eow dyde on \u00f0am westene, o\u00f0 ge comon to \u00f0isse stowe, & hu seo eor\u00f0e Ge gesawen ealle \u00f0a m\u00e6ran Drihtnes weorc, \u00fee he worhte, & gehyrdon his word \u00f0us cwe\u00f0ende; Nu to \u00d0onne Drihten eow gel\u00e6t on \u00f0\u00e6t land \u00f0e ge to fara\u00f0 on to eardigenne, \u00feonne set he bletsunga uppan WYRCEA\u00f0 ealle \u00f0a \u00f0ingc \u00f0e Drihten eow bebead, & ne ice ge nan \u00f0ingc \u00f0\u00e6rto, ne ne wania\u00f0. GYF \u00e6nig witega arise betwynan eow, & secge \u00f0\u00e6t hine m\u00e6te swefen, & secge tacnu & forebeacnu, Ne hlyste \u00f0u his worda , for \u00f0an \u00f0e Drihten fanda\u00f0 eower, hw\u00e6\u00f0er ge hine lufian mid eallum mode. Fylia\u00f0 Drihtne, eowrum Gode, & ondr\u00e6da\u00f0 hine & healda\u00f0 his bebodu & gehyra\u00f0 hine & \u00f0eowia\u00f0 Slea man \u00f0one leasan witegan, for \u00f0am \u00f0e he awende eow fram Drihtne, eowrum Gode, \u00f0e eow ut Gyf \u00f0in bro\u00f0or \u00f0e",
